mindmap
  root((Tenses))
    Present Tenses
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Simple: V1+s/es
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Continuous: is/am/are+V1+ing
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Perfect: has/have+V3
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Perf. Continuous: have+been+ing
    Past Tenses
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Simple: V2
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Continuous: was/were+ing
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Perfect: had+V3
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Perf. Continuous: had+been+ing
    Future Tenses
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Simple: will+V1
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Continuous: will+be+ing
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Perfect: will+have+V3
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Going to  planned
    Signal Words
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Since/For → Perfect
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Yesterday/Ago → Past
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Tomorrow/Next → Future
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Always/Often → Present
    Conditionals
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Type 1: If + V1, will + V1
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Type 2: If + V2, would + V1
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Type 3: If + had + V3, would have + V3
    State Verbs
      ::icon(fas fa-check)
      Stative verbs  know, love  cannot be continuous